1
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:04,670
停止计时
And, time.

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,920
37分钟
37 minutes,

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:09,120
从家里出发 到坐上地铁
we got from the apartment to the subway,

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,880
最后到达学校 又刷新记录了
to the pastery school in record time.

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,320
虽然我来不及穿胸罩
I mean, I'm not wearing a bra,

6
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,920
而且丁字裤好像也前后穿反了
and my thong might be on backwards.

7
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,940
丁字裤怎么会穿反呢
There is no wrong way to wear a thong,

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,020
只要不舒服就对了
as long as it's uncomfortable.

9
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,080
而且你穿胸罩也只是摆设而已
And with you, the bra is just for decoration.

10
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,720
而我是必须得穿
I have to wear one because you get a ticket

11
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,140
"孩子"不放安全座椅上 是要吃罚单的
for not put the kids in a car seat.

12
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,020
教室见 我得先跟我老婆道别
See you in class guys, I gotta say good bye to my wife.

13
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,760
你真以为我要跟你吻别吗
You think I was gonna kiss you?

14
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:35,137
对啊
Yes.

15
00:00:35,137 --> 00:00:36,654
我是你老婆 你是我那位
I'm the wife, you are the husband

16
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,260
某天被我发现你有异装癖
who I caught wearing my cloth one day,

17
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,580
但我却没戳穿的老公
but I don't say anything about it.

18
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,540
早安啊 二位
Morning, guys.

19
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,160
早安 碧碧
Oh, hi, Bebe.

20
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,180
见到我很惊讶吧
Surprised to see me, right?

21
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,620
大家总以为我会在夜半时分自杀
Everyone always thinks I'm not gonna make it through the night,

22
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,740
但我还活着 连我自己都惊讶
but here I am, even surprised myself.

23
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,400
跟一个随时会崩溃的人
What's it like working in an office

24
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,280
在同一间办公室工作是什么感觉呢
with someone who's about to snap like a breadstick?

25
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,080
绝对没想象中这么有趣
Not as much fun as you'd think.

26
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,660
但碧碧人很好 而且在这工作
But Bebe's sweet, and working here

27
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,940
主要是为了替你挣学费
is putting you through pastry school.

28
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,360
-好啦 再见 -再见
- Okay, bye. - Bye.

29
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,840
-我要离婚 -早去申请了
- I want a divorce. - I already filed.

30
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,800
老婆 我要五块钱
Hey, wife, I need $5

31
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,640
赔昨天弄坏的工具
to pay for a spatula I broke yesterday.

32
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,480
我昨天突然戈登·拉姆齐上身了
I was having a Gordon Ramsay moment.

33
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:31,340
有机会我不介意跟他睡哦
I'd have sex with him, by the way.

34
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,760
为啥 他肯定也是会吼你
Why? He'd just be yelling at you

35
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,140
然后说你"做"错了
and telling you you're doing it wrong.

36
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:38,760
做爱不都这样吗
Yeah, sex.

37
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:41,740
拿吧 钱在我包里
Take it. It's in my purse.

38
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,720
碧碧 你有偷偷不吃的药吗
Yo, Bebe, you got any extra pills you're not taking?

39
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,140
没有 我全都有吃
No, I'm taking them all.

40
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:50,660
老天爷 别啊
Oh, my God, no.

41
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:53,040
干嘛 我也就想要个一颗 两颗
What? I just wanted one. Or two.

42
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,200
就想减减压
Just to take the edge off.

43
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,340
三点我有一场生奶油考试
I have a whipped cream final at 3:00.

44
00:01:56,580 --> 00:01:58,080
是报纸里的讣告
No. In the obituaries.

45
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,040
我认识这个人
I know this person.

46
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,080
"安东尼娅·佛罗伦蒂诺 享年八十
"Antonia Florentino, 80,

47
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,640
在睡梦中安详过世"
Died peacefully in her sleep."

48
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,220
明显是自杀嘛 对吧
That's a suicide, right?

49
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,940
她是我的保姆
She was my nanny.

50
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:15,040
你现在还有保姆啊
You still have a nanny?

51
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:16,760
真幸福
Lucky.

52
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,300
我小时候大多数时间都是她带大的
She took care of me most of my childhood.

53
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,060
我好爱她
I loved her so much.

54
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,440
节哀
So sorry.

55
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:25,720
我对我的老邻居卡拉
That's kind of how I felt

56
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,980
也有这种感觉
about my old neighbor, Carla.

57
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,940
虽然她没有养育我
I mean, she didn't take care of me,

58
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,160
但在我小的时候 她都允许我
but when I was a kid, she used to let me

59
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,040
喝她家花园水管的水
drink out of her hose.

60
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,380
我最后一次见安东尼娅 是她载我
The last time I saw Antonia, she was driving me

61
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:38,000
和邋遢鬼妮莉·费塔朵一起去参加青少年选择奖
and a sloppy Nelly Furtado to the Teen Choice Awards.

62
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,520
现在可以在办公室里哭了吗
Oh, are we allowed to cry at work now?

63
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:42,840
我一般只在车里哭
'cause I only do it in my car.

64
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,380
麦克斯 你知道我意识到什么吗
Max, you know what I just realized?

65
00:02:54,060 --> 00:02:57,040
这是我保姆死后 我第一次走进这家餐厅
This is the first time I've been here since my nanny died.

66
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,940
这话你已经在墨西哥快餐店说过了
You just said that at Chipotle.

67
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:03,020
然后十分钟后 你又说了一遍
And then you said it again ten minutes later,

68
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:04,000
也是在那家快餐店
also at chipotle.

69
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,880
有点同情心好吗
Show some sensitivity.

70
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,940
我当时哭是因为我保姆死了
I was crying because my nanny died.

71
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,880
也因为我们悼念的早午餐是在一家快餐店
And also because our grief brunch was at Chipotle.

72
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,440
卡洛琳 你的保姆过世啦
Caroline, your nanny passed?

73
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,700
我深表同情 宝贝 太遗憾了
My sympathies, sweetheart. That's a shame.

74
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:20,200
但没有什么比黑人葬礼更棒的了
But there is nothing better than a black funeral.

75
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,100
我1984年时参加了我爷爷的葬礼 至今宿醉未醒
I'm still hung over from my grandpa's in '84.

76
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:26,720
厄尔 我的保姆是白人
Earl, my nanny was white.

77
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,260
你的保姆居然是白人
Your nanny was white?

78
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,700
小姑娘 你的确是富二代啊
Child, you were rich.

79
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:32,940
你看见阿憨了吗
Have you seen Han?

80
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,500
葬礼明天在费城举行
The funeral's in Philadelphia tomorrow,

81
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:35,300
我得跟他请一天假
and I need the day off.

82
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:37,260
我之前好像看见他了
Well, I think I saw him earlier.

83
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,760
但话说回来 那也有可能是一只猫
But then again, it might have been a cat.

84
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:42,680
我们俩都需要请一天假
Hey, we both need the day off.

85
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:44,414
我要陪你去 无论是出于精神支持
I'm going with you for moral support/

86
00:03:44,414 --> 00:03:45,940
还是为了吃第一个费城牛肉三明治
my first cheesesteak/

87
00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:47,620
或我想使劲甩独立钟里面的那个大球
I want to ride the liberty bell like a wrecking ball.

88
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:52,480
我刚在《科技新时代》看到一篇超级疯狂的文章
I just read the craziest article in this Popular Science

89
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,780
是关于"白矮"星 黑"洞"和天王星[你屁眼]
about White Dwarfs, black holes, and Uranus.

90
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:58,880
不对 让我重新说一遍
Oh, no. Let me start over.

91
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:02,700
阿憨 我们明天要请假 我保姆过世了
Han, we need tomorrow off. My nanny died.

92
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:04,000
她就像是我的母亲
She was like a mother to me.

93
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:05,340
但她不是你的母亲
But she was not your mother.

94
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,880
餐厅有明确的规定
And diner rules clearly state

95
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:09,080
必须是自己家人的葬礼才能请假
you can only take off for the death of a family member.

96
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:12,300
餐厅还规定不许在上班时候喝酒呢
Well, the rules also say no drinking on the job,

97
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:12,620
但现在
but...

98
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,560
好吧 你可以去
Okay, yes, you can go.

99
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,580
因为在我们国家
Because in my culture,

100
00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:21,160
对长辈是十分尊敬的
it's important to honor the elderly.

101
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,160
我跟一位97的老人同睡上下铺
I shared a bunk bed with a 97-year-old

102
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,160
一直睡到我22岁呢
till I was 22.

103
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,980
敢问你是在"上面"还是"下面"
Were you on the top or bottom?

104
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,120
我向来是在下面啊
Oh, I was always the bottom.

105
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,680
不对 让我重新说一遍
Oh, no. Let me start over.

106
00:04:39,940 --> 00:04:40,780
卡洛琳
Hey, Caroline.

107
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:43,120
我收到你保姆过世的短信了
I got your nanny death text.

108
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:45,580
所以我出于尊重 穿上了一身黑
So I'm wearing black out of respect.

109
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,040
而且 刚好我的月事也来了
And also, I got my period.

110
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,780
谢谢 苏菲 太有爱了
Thanks, Sophie. That's lovely.

111
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,260
是吗 哪部分
It is? Which part?

112
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:57,660
在波兰 我保姆死的时候
You know, back in Poland when my nanny died,

113
00:04:57,760 --> 00:05:01,720
我心都碎了 难过得都吃不下她了
I was so heartbroken, I could barely eat her.

114
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,480
你居然吃你死掉的保姆
You ate your dead nanny?

115
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,980
山羊终究是动物
Well, a goat's a goat.

116
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,340
称呼改变不了本质
It doesn't matter what you name it.

117
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,340
它仍是美味的羊肉
It's still good goat meat.

118
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,260
好了 我去我卡座里坐着了
All right, I'll be in my booth.

119
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:27,220
一份金枪鱼三明治和三颗痛经药 谢谢
I'm going to order a tuna melt and three Midol, please.

120
00:05:29,380 --> 00:05:30,820
等等 我们要怎么去费城啊
Wait, how are we gonna get there?

121
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,300
碧碧说她有车 我们可以问问她
Oh, Bebe said she had a car, we can just ask her.

122
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,000
我不想跟她坐同一辆车
I don't want to get in a car with her.

123
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,820
我连跟她说话都不想
I don't even want to get in a conversation with her.

124
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,080
我可以载你们去
I can drive you.

125
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:41,540
但我们得先去我巴克斯县的姐姐家
We just have to stop at my sister's in Bucks County,

126
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,920
拿一个没有任何标记的包裹
pick up an unmarked package,

127
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,840
然后再送到康乃迪克州
and swing by Connecticut to drop it off.

128
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:49,060
奥列格 这个包裹里有违法的东西吗
Oleg, is there anything illegal about this delivery?

129
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:50,700
没有 只是几双鞋
No, it's just some shoes...

130
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,260
里面塞满可卡因而已
stuffed with cocaine.

131
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:55,560
对了 鞋子是用印度大麻做的哦
Also the shoes are made of hashish.

132
00:05:57,540 --> 00:05:58,440
我还是打给碧碧好了
I'll call Bebe.

133
00:05:59,020 --> 00:06:00,240
好吧 但我要坐后座
Okay, but I'm sitting in the back

134
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,840
因为我不想沾染到她的疯气
'cause I don't want the crazy to get on me.

135
00:06:08,220 --> 00:06:09,780
碧碧 你送我们去葬礼
Bebe, I can't thank you enough

136
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:11,040
真是太感谢你了
for driving us to the funeral.

137
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,820
现在车速才20迈 其实你可以开快点的
We're only going 20. You can go faster if you want.

138
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,640
是啊 刚有一棵树超过了我们
Yeah, we just got passed by a tree.

139
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:21,340
你那只爱放屁和神经紧张的可卡犬
And I'm especially thrilled your nervous cocker spaniel

140
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,500
也跟着来 真让我尤为振奋
with gas and hot spots got to join us.

141
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,280
够了 你现在都开到100迈了
Okay, now you're going 100.

142
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,200
其实你可以开慢点的
We can go slower if you want.

143
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,800
抱歉 我的专长是做事极端
Sorry. Extremes-- that's my thing.

144
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:34,120
有一次我搬家到东京住了一天
One time I moved to Tokyo for a day.

145
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:38,180
-麦克斯 又来了 -我知道
- Max, it just hit me again. - I know.

146
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:39,540
貌似她给那只狗吃了西兰花
It's like she feeds him broccoli.

147
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,055
不是啦
No.

148
00:06:42,055 --> 00:06:44,680
是我又想到安东尼娅真的去世了
That Antonia is really dead.

149
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,400
好消息是 根据点评网
Well, the good news is, according to Yelp,

150
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:47,580
她葬礼距离最出名的那家
she's dead about two blocks

151
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:49,340
费城牛肉奶酪三明治只有两个街区
From the famous philly cheesesteak place.

152
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,400
麦克斯 放尊重点行吗
Max, show some respect.

153
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:52,520
我又不认识她
Well, I didn't know her.

154
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:54,400
老实说 我只当她是帮我和牛肉三明治
In fact, I only know her as the lady who brought me

155
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,560
牵红线的媒人
and cheesesteaks together.

156
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:58,940
即使我们从未见过面 但对于安东尼娅的家人来说
Even though we've never met, it'll mean so much

157
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:01,400
我的出席对他们来说意义重大
to Antonia's family that I came out of respect.

158
00:07:01,820 --> 00:07:03,360
对我的心理医生来说也意义重大
It'll mean so much to my therapist

159
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,540
因为我离开我的安全区
that I left my safe zone

160
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:05,900
还只带了一条狗
and only brought one of the dogs.

161
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,320
麦克斯 你觉得除了我的悼词之外
Max, do you think in addition to my eulogy,

162
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:11,260
我还应该念几段我儿时的日记吗
I should read something from my childhood journal?

163
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,740
不应该 但我觉得你还是会执意念
I don't, but I think you're gonna do it anyway.

164
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:16,800
"1997年 圣诞节早上
"Christmas morning, 1997.

165
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,260
安东尼娅用一杯热可可和一根我最爱的
Antonia woke me up with a cup of hot cocoa

166
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,780
薄荷棒棒糖叫醒我
and my favorite peppermint stick,

167
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:22,460
然后我们开始拆礼物"
and then we opened presents."

168
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,600
1997年 圣诞节早上
Christmas morning, 1997.

169
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:26,700
我冲我妈脸上泼了一杯冰水
I threw cold water on my mother's face.

170
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:28,720
直到元旦那天 她人还是没反应
New year's day-- still no movement.

171
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:34,600
这是我手上唯一一张我们的合影
This is the only picture I still have of us.

172
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:37,000
那是我们一起过的第一个万圣节
It was our first Halloween together.

173
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:38,000
我当时四岁
I was four.

174
00:07:38,340 --> 00:07:41,960
瞧她给我做的那身可爱的小鸡装束
Look at that cute little baby chick costume she made me.

175
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:42,740
唧唧 唧唧
Peep, peep.

176
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:45,620
真可爱
Aw, so cute.

177
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,320
看车
Car.

178
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,840
我从来没穿过万圣节服装
I never had a Halloween costume.

179
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:53,380
我通常是把头发乱糟糟地扎起来
I used to put my hair in a messy bun

180
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:54,620
然后跌跌撞撞地挨家挨户敲门
and stumble from door-to-door

181
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:55,840
告诉大家我就是我妈
telling people I was my mother.

182
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:59,240
今年万圣节 我打扮成我的医生迈克
This Halloween, I went as my doctor, Michael.

183
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,260
我把我的狗狗打扮成
And I dressed up my buddy here

184
00:08:01,260 --> 00:08:02,440
他的爱人 约瑟夫
As his lover, Joseph.

185
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:04,620
我们后来情不自禁
We lost.

186
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:08,320
安东尼娅一直陪在我身边
Antonia was always there for me--

187
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,740
万圣节 圣诞节 复活节 每一个节日
Halloween, Christmas, Easter-- every holiday.

188
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,940
每一天
Really, every day.

189
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:14,060
她就像我妈妈一样
She was really like a mother to me.

190
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:15,460
那你真正的妈妈呢
Where was your real mother?

191
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,140
这只是什么品种的狗啊
Hey, what kind of dog is that?

192
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,260
除了"苦瓜脸品种"外
I mean, besides "Sad"?

193
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,280
她妈妈跟人偷情 然后被扫地出门
Her mother had an affair, got pushed out.

194
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,980
那是她的痛处 所以别随便碰
That's her hot spot, so don't lick it.

195
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:25,900
没关系 麦克斯 我不需要任何保护
It's okay, Max, I don't need any protection.

196
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:27,180
你不需要任何保护[措施]
You don't need protection?

197
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,900
你是谁 跟我约过会的男人吗
Who are you, every guy I've ever dated?

198
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,360
碧碧 没错 我妈妈是背叛了我爸爸
Bebe, yes, my mother was unfaithful to my father,

199
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,260
所以她被赶走了
so she was sent away.

200
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:35,860
但我有安东尼娅 她照顾我
But I had Antonia and she took care of me.

201
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:36,840
她就是我的家人
She was my family.

202
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:39,480
那一定很难熬 人人都需要妈妈
That must have been hard. Everybody needs a mother.

203
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,280
我没有我妈 一定会疯掉的
I'd be crazy without my mother.

204
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,160
我看病都是她载我去的
She drives me to all my appointments.

205
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:45,820
但你不是会开车吗
But you drive.

206
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:48,020
是啊
Yeah...

207
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:49,560
但医生不让我开
But I'm not supposed to.

208
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,900
我让碧碧在车里等着没事吧
It's okay I asked Bebe to wait in the car, right?

209
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,840
她不会憋死的 有扇车窗留了一条缝
I mean, she'll be okay. We cracked a window.

210
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:03,580
是啊 她有个碗和一个宠物用咀嚼玩具
Yeah, and she's got a bowl and a chew-toy.

211
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,680
来吧 过来签到
Come on, let's sign in.

212
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,500
麦克斯 当我见到她家人时 我要振作
Max, I have to keep it together when I meet the family.

213
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:12,760
我不能太动情
I can't be all emotional.

214
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,800
瞧 我的手在抖 太可怕了
Look, my hand's shaking. This is terrible.

215
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:22,880
干嘛 刚才的签名丑死了
What? It was a terrible signature.

216
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,420
而且那页也只有五个其他人的名字而已
And there were only five other names on the page.

217
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,060
处理掉它
Get rid of it.

218
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,860
"处理掉它"
"Get rid of it"?

219
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,420
你是谁 跟我约过会的男人吗
Who are you, every guy I've ever dated?

220
00:09:31,423 --> 00:09:33,980
"卡洛琳·钱宁"
"Caroline Channing."

221
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:34,620
给 麦克斯
Here, Max.

222
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:36,980
瞧
Oh, look.

223
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,400
这里的花和一切都好美
The flowers and everything are so beautiful.

224
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,820
好了
There you go.

225
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:43,640
你居然签"费成·三明智"
You signed "Phil E. Cheesesteak"?

226
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:48,960
你告诉我不要再提这件事了
You told me not to mention it anymore,

227
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,140
所以那只是个提醒而已
so it's just a reminder.

228
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,480
麦克斯 到时候一定会有很多人
Okay, Max, there are gonna be a lot of people

229
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,760
想要得到我的关注 所以拜托要耐心
who will want my attention, so please be patient

230
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:57,880
站在我身边 偶尔给我支持的依靠
and stand next to me for the occasional supportive lean.

231
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,520
如果有人开始哭得太夸张
And if someone starts to get too weepy,

232
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:00,400
立刻把他们从我身上拉开
push them out of the way

233
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,720
因为这条裙子可不能沾上眼泪
because I can't get tears on this dress.

234
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,400
我明天九点前还得退给百货公司
It has to be back to Barneys by 9:00 A.M.

235
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:06,900
你来了
You're here.

236
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:07,940
开始了 麦克斯
Here we go, Max.

237
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,640
我刚是跟他说话
I was talking to him.

238
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:23,040
当然当然 今天对我们来说都很伤心
Of course you were. It's a very sad day for us all.

239
00:10:26,100 --> 00:10:27,800
真是太伤了
That was rough.

240
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,200
麦克斯 看
Max, look.

241
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,380
这就是安东尼娅
This is Antonia.

242
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,360
她看起来人很好
She looks really nice.

243
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,500
的确
She was.

244
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,660
原来她还在军队待过
I didn't know she was in the military.

245
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:43,600
难怪床单四个边角弄得那么利落
But it does explain those fabulous bed sheet corners.

246
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,780
等等 你居然不知道你的保姆是海军吗
Wait, you didn't know your nanny was a marine?

247
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,840
真是太糟糕了 如果是我就会炫耀
That's too bad, 'cause I'd be all,

248
00:10:49,060 --> 00:10:50,080
"喂 其他有钱的小屁孩
"Yo, other little rich kid!

249
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,500
老娘的保姆能轻易折断你们脖子哦"
My nanny can snap your neck."

250
00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:56,320
瞧 那俩是她的姐妹 塞西莉亚和安吉拉
Oh, look. There are her sisters, Cecelia and Angela,

251
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,720
这几个是她的侄子和侄女
and there are her nieces and nephews.

252
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:01,360
这些照片居然没一张有我
And there is not me anywhere.

253
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,302
我的照片肯定跟其他重要人物
You know, my picture must be in the coffin

254
00:11:03,302 --> 00:11:05,639
一起放在棺材里
With the other V.I.P.S.

255
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:10,040
如果你是个重要人物 能叫人上酒吗
If you're a V.I.P., can we get some bottle service?

256
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:12,240
下午好 女士们
Good afternoon, ladies.

257
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,660
我是安东尼 安东尼娅的侄子
I'm Anthony, Antonia's nephew.

258
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:16,480
真是令人难过的一天
It's sad day, huh?

259
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,560
没错
Yes, it is.

260
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:21,040
我觉得我现在也没这么难过了
Think I just got a little less sad.

261
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:22,120
安东尼
Oh! Anthony!

262
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:25,300
住手 我们可是一家人
Stop. We're family.

263
00:11:25,380 --> 00:11:26,620
我是卡洛琳·钱宁
I'm Caroline Channing.

264
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:28,840
我只知道你是卡洛琳辣妹
You're Caroline "Hot," is all I know.

265
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,460
你们俩是要用信封装钱
You ladies need cash envelopes

266
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,100
还是要不要都行
or you guys cool?

267
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:35,720
我最缺的就是装钱的信封了
I always need a cash envelope.

268
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,920
抱歉 信封要拿来装什么啊
I'm sorry, envelopes for what?

269
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:41,561
根据意大利葬礼的习俗 哀悼者瞻仰死者遗容后
Well, at Italian wakes, the mourners give the family

270
00:11:41,561 --> 00:11:43,757
会捐一点钱给死者家属
a donation after they view the deceased.

271
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:44,720
所以是要"按次收费"瞻仰吗
So it's pay-per-view?

272
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,860
这句吐槽太犀利了
That was a good one.

273
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,500
晚点要一起喝一杯吗
Hey, you want to go get a pop later?

274
00:11:52,460 --> 00:11:54,980
我们完事就走了 但好吧 安东尼
We're leaving right after, but yes, Anthony.

275
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:56,100
谢谢 麻烦给我们个信封
Thank you. We'll take an envelope.

276
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:59,380
遗体就在前面
The body's right through there.

277
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:01,980
一直往前走
Go right ahead.

278
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,380
安东尼 住手
Anthony, stop.

279
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:05,780
我真的好紧张啊
I'm really nervous.

280
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:07,460
我以前从来没见过尸体
I've never seen a dead body before.

281
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:08,760
我见多了
I've seen a bunch.

282
00:12:09,140 --> 00:12:10,240
有几具还是拜我所赐
A couple of them were my fault.

283
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,100
我没有现金
I don't have any cash.

284
00:12:13,140 --> 00:12:15,000
-你有带钱吗 -我看看我的钱包
- Do you have any money? - Let me check my wallet.

285
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,960
这是名牌密封塑胶袋 可不是什么山寨货哦
This is a real Ziploc, not one of those knock-offs.

286
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:24,080
一定要把信封封好
Make sure you seal the envelope,

287
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,320
好让别人觉得里面都是25美分的硬币
so people think it's all quarters.

288
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,260
麦克斯 下一个到我们了
Max, we're next.

289
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:29,720
我好害怕 牵住我的手
I'm afraid. Hold my hand.

290
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:31,260
牵手 你以为我们是什么
Hold hands? What are we?

291
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:32,600
基督徒约会网站上第五次约会的男女吗
On a ChristianMingle fifth date?

292
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,940
拜托了 麦克斯 我好紧张啊
Please, Max. I'm nervous.

293
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:39,080
-天啊 -谢谢
- Oh, God. - Thank you.

294
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:40,300
好了 松手
Okay. Now give it back.

295
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,360
干嘛 这已经是我维持最长的一段感情了
What? That was just my longest relationship.

296
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:46,560
再说了 我得把这些零钱放进信封里
Plus, I need it to put this change in the envelope.

297
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:52,680
她看起来一脸平静
Oh, she looks so peaceful.

298
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:56,120
安东尼娅 我是卡洛琳
Hi, Antonia. It's me, Caroline.

299
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:59,780
我应该亲她吗 她家人在旁边看着呢
Should I kiss her? The family is right there watching.

300
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,240
前面那个女士就亲了
The lady before us kissed her.

301
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:03,280
亲吧 反正看样子她也不会推开你
Go for it. Doesn't look like she'd fight you.

302
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,000
好的 数到三
Okay, on the count of three.

303
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:08,215
一 二
One, two--

304
00:13:08,215 --> 00:13:10,062
不行 麦克斯 牵着我的手
No! Max, hold my hand again while I--

305
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,580
我们该怎么办
What do we do?

306
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,940
住手 别捡了 反正我们也要给她家人的
Wait, leave it! We were giving it to them anyway.

307
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:21,200
不是全部都给啊 那可是我们买三明治的钱
Not all of it. That's our cheesesteak money.

308
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,440
别捡了 快过来
Leave it. Come on.

309
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:27,080
刚才的事真是非常抱歉
I am so, so sorry about that.

310
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:29,211
我实在是太紧张了 你懂的
My nerves got the best of me. You understand.

311
00:13:29,211 --> 00:13:32,000
我是塞西莉亚 安东尼娅的
I'm Cecelia, Antonia's--

312
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:32,660
妹妹 我知道
Sister. I know.

313
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:34,160
你们俩长得很像
I see the resemblance.

314
00:13:34,860 --> 00:13:35,520
我是卡洛琳
I'm Caroline.

315
00:13:38,300 --> 00:13:39,180
谁啊 卡洛琳
Caroline who?

316
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,580
卡洛琳·钱宁啊
Oh. Caroline Channing.

317
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,920
谁是卡洛琳·钱宁
Caroline Channing who?

318
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,960
你现在心情不好想不起 可以理解
You're having a hard time processing. Understandable.

319
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,900
今天对我们所有人来说都非常难过
It's been a very emotional day for us all.

320
00:13:53,340 --> 00:13:54,220
这个女孩是谁
Who is this girl?

321
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:57,520
你 我倒觉得我在哪里见过你
You, I feel like I've seen somewhere.

322
00:13:58,180 --> 00:14:00,420
你是里基在罗彻斯特的女友吗
Are you Ricky's girl From Rochester?

323
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:03,380
有可能 是的话对我有什么好处
I could be. What's in it for me?

324
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,900
安东尼娅在我小时候照顾过我
Antonia used to take care of me when I was little.

325
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,220
安东尼娅是你的临时保姆啊
Oh, Antonia was your baby-sitter.

326
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,920
你能来真好
Very nice of you to come.

327
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:15,140
她不是我的"临时保姆"
Well, she was hardly my "baby-sitter."

328
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:18,540
她十年来的每一天都在照顾我
She took care of me every day for ten years.

329
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,760
我是卡洛琳 卡洛琳·钱宁啊
Caroline. Caroline Channing.

330
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:24,920
很抱歉 但我真不认识你 亲爱的
I'm sorry, but I don't know who you are, sweetheart,

331
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:29,240
虽然你一直在向我施压 逼我假装认识你
Though it seems to be what you're hammering me about.

332
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:32,280
容我失陪一下
If you'll excuse me,

333
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,380
我要去抽根烟
I need a cigarette.

334
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,440
抽完了我还得去捡
And then I got to remove

335
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,560
掉在我姐姐身上的钢镚
some of those pennies off of my sister.

336
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:41,260
那是口棺材 不是什么许愿井
It's a coffin, not a wishing well.

337
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,800
这个葬礼变得好令人感到沉重[沮丧]
This funeral turned out to be very depressing.

338
00:14:52,734 --> 00:14:53,871
没错
Well, yeah.

339
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:56,060
有个死人躺在这里 不死气沉沉都难
Dead body in the room, generally a buzz-kill.

340
00:14:57,620 --> 00:14:59,000
除非这是爱尔兰式守灵
Unless it's an Irish wake--

341
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,680
这样你就可以隔着棺材玩啤酒乒乓啦
then you're playing beer pong off the coffin.

342
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:03,900
我的意思是 这家人
No, I mean, how is it possible

343
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:05,520
怎么可能没一个人认识我呢
that the family doesn't even know me?

344
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:07,560
难道安东尼娅从来没提起过我吗
Did Antonia never even mention me?

345
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,200
你应该往好的方面想
Let's focus on the positive.

346
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,700
安东尼真的很喜欢你的小屁屁
Anthony really liked your ass.

347
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,300
我知道我和安东尼娅拥有过什么
I know what Antonia and I had.

348
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:16,300
这就是我们拥有的回忆
This is what we had.

349
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:17,320
唧唧 唧唧
Peep, peep.

350
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,340
那是我们的美好回忆
That's what we had.

351
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:20,100
那已经很多啦
Well, that's a lot.

352
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:23,200
但我猜这家人不会承认我们的回忆
But I guess no one in this family wants to admit that,

353
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,200
这真是太遗憾了
and it's a shame too,

354
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,400
因为我准备了很棒的悼词
because I had a great eulogy.

355
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:26,900
是吗
You do?

356
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:28,800
是的 没错
Yes. I do.

357
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:30,220
你想让我跟你分享吗
Would you like me to share it with you?

358
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:32,300
当然想啊
I most certainly would.

359
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,520
你不是真的要拿你的烂悼词
You are not seriously eulogy-bombing

360
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,600
去精神轰炸那位老太太吧
that old lady, are you?

361
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,232
是她先问起我的悼词的
She asked me about my great eulogy.

362
00:15:39,232 --> 00:15:40,480
她都一百岁了
She's a hundred.

363
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,480
很可能听成你说你有一位很棒的泌尿科医生
She probably thought you said you had a great urologist.

364
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,800
你有笔吗
Do you have a pen?

365
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:48,260
我要记下她医生的名字
I'm getting the name of her doctor.

366
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,440
不 夫人 我说的不是"泌尿科医生"
No, ma'am, I didn't say, "urologist."

367
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:54,740
我说的是"悼词" 很棒的悼词[音似]
I said, "eulogy." A great eulogy.

368
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:57,540
你凭啥上去念悼词啊
Why would you give the eulogy?

369
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:01,620
因为我是卡洛琳·钱宁
Because I'm Caroline Channing.

370
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:02,520
谁呀
Who?

371
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:05,100
卡洛琳·钱宁
Caroline Channing.

372
00:16:06,180 --> 00:16:07,460
卡洛琳·钱宁
Caroline Channing.

373
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,700
安东尼娅是我的保姆
Antonia was my nanny.

374
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:11,660
我家过去超级有钱
My family was rich,

375
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:13,260
但后来我父亲骗走了全世界的钱
but then my father robbed everyone,

376
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:15,300
于是我们沦为害群之马
and we became the scourge of society,

377
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,560
同一周 梅尔·吉布森仇视犹太人的言论
overshadowed a little bit by Mel Gibson

378
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,960
盖过了我家丑闻风头一点点
hating the Jews that same week.

379
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,960
你们绝对应该记得
Surely, you remember?

380
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:26,420
小宝贝 我连怎么来这里的都不记得了
Honey, I don't even remember how I got here.

381
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,060
真是难以置信
I can't believe this.

382
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:33,900
我整个童年之所以"快乐"都是因为
I constructed my entire "Happy" Childhood

383
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,480
我坚信 就算我妈离开了我
On the fact that even though my mom left

384
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,040
就算她不爱我
and apparently didn't love me,

385
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,000
但还有安东尼娅爱我
Antonia did.

386
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:40,360
而我来了这里 我意识到
And now I get here and I realize

387
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:42,340
没人爱过我 她只是为了挣钱
no one loved me, I was just a paycheck.

388
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:43,940
我只是她照顾的众多小孩中的一个
One of the many kids she baby-sat.

389
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,700
我甚至不知道我来这里的意义是什么
I don't even know why I bothered to come.

390
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:49,240
我去一趟洗手间 然后我们就走
I'm going to the restroom and then we can just leave.

391
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:55,260
打扰一下 你好
Excuse me. Hi.

392
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,680
我是麦克斯 里基的女友
Max, Ricky's girl.

393
00:16:58,260 --> 00:17:00,340
我知道现在你很难过
I know this is a hard time for you,

394
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:02,280
但对我朋友来说 她也很难过
but it's a hard time for my friend as well.

395
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,980
即使你从来没有听说过她
And even though you never heard of her,

396
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:06,480
但我恳请你能否过去
I was wondering if you could just go over there,

397
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,520
对她说你想起来了
and say you just remembered her,

398
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,140
安东尼娅经常在你们面前提起她
and that Antonia talked about her all the time?

399
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:12,300
我明白这是要你说谎推翻你之前的话
I know it's a 180 on your original story and a lie,

400
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,380
我也乐意给你辛苦费
and I'd offer to pay you for your trouble,

401
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:17,940
但我的养老金全在装着你姐姐的盒子里了
but my 401k is laying in that box on top of your sister.

402
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:23,880
我是看在你男人里基的面子 才没赶你俩走
Look, I only permitted you two to stay

403
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:27,040
要不是去年乔舅舅从楼顶摔下来时
'cause your Ricky was so nice to uncle Joe

404
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:29,120
全靠他出手相救
when he fell off the roof last year.

405
00:17:29,940 --> 00:17:32,120
但现在 你们还是离开这吧
But now, you gotta go.

406
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:36,220
好吧 随便你好了
Okay. Be that way.

407
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:39,440
但下次乔舅舅要去做透析时 里奇不会去接他的
But don't expect Ricky to pick up Uncle Joe for dialysis.

408
00:17:46,220 --> 00:17:47,540
麦克斯 你这是干什么
Max, what are you doing?

409
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,880
是那家人让我贴上去的
The family asked me to put it up.

410
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:51,000
他们想起你来了
They just remembered you.

411
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,620
天啊
Oh, my God.

412
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:54,980
我有这么可悲吗 需要你粘照片
I'm so pathetic, you have to put up my picture

413
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:55,980
来哄我吗
to make me feel better?

414
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,720
在某种程度上 是的
In a way, yes.

415
00:17:59,380 --> 00:18:00,860
这照片本来就应该贴在这里
It belongs up there.

416
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,320
谁不想会认识这个孩子啊
Who wouldn't want to know that kid?

417
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,580
很高兴见到你 安东尼娅
Nice to meet you, Antonia.

418
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:05,900
千万不要做鬼来找我们
Please don't haunt us.

419
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,300
快上路吧 我们还要买牛肉三明治呢
Now, let's hit the road and get some freaking cheesesteaks!

420
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,800
麦克斯 快把照片弄下来
Max, please take that down.

421
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:12,100
太丢脸了
It's so embarrassing.

422
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:13,940
这里没人认识我
Nobody here knows anything about me.

423
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:16,340
他们也不认识我啊 小鸡仔
They didn't know me either, chicken.

424
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:18,300
你叫谁小鸡仔呢
Hey, who you callin' chicken?

425
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:22,160
我 那是安东尼娅给我起的昵称
Me. That was Antonia's nickname for me.

426
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,200
你知道我是谁吗
You know who I am?

427
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:24,540
我当然知道
Of course I do.

428
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:27,320
安东尼娅的小鸡仔 她的小唧唧
Antonia's little chick, her peep.

429
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,860
她很爱你
She loved you.

430
00:18:29,860 --> 00:18:32,440
她也喜欢给你做那套装束
And she loved making you that costume.

431
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:36,020
整个厨房餐桌上全铺满了亮片
Took the whole kitchen table up with all those sequins,

432
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:39,300
她知道你就该是最耀眼的那一个
But she knew you deserved to sparkle.

433
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:42,920
她非常爱你 我根本没办法抱怨
She loved you so much, I couldn't begin to complain.

434
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:45,980
不好意思 请问您是哪位
I'm so sorry. What was your name?

435
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:48,540
我是梅格·欧哈拉 我是她的室友
I'm Meg O'Hara. I was her roommate.

436
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:49,920
兼爱人
And lover.

437
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,320
我们在一起30年了
We were together 30 years.

438
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,940
军队拉拉情
The military!

439
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:06,060
没错 明眼人一看就知道了
I know, right? I mean, come on.

440
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:09,200
当时在坦克那 我的手可是搂着她啊
That's me with my arm around her on that tank.

441
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:12,160
而那一家子蠢蛋却还是看不出来
And the family still had no clue.

442
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,200
老一代蕾丝边 超级酷啊
Vintage lez-- very cool.

443
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:20,620
安东尼娅会希望你收下这些照片
I know Toni would have wanted you to have these.

444
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:24,680
感谢你的到来 小鸡仔
Oh, thanks for coming, chicken.

445
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:28,220
你大概是这世界上唯一一个
You're probably the only person in the world

446
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:31,340
对她的爱像我一样纯粹的人了
who loved her as purely as I did.

447
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,780
麦克斯 看
Max, look.

448
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:40,640
圣诞节的照片
Christmas.

449
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:42,940
我生日时的照片
And my birthday.

450
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:45,140
还有参加青少年选择奖时的照片
And the Teen Choice Awards.

451
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:52,260
节哀顺变
I'm sorry for your loss.

452
00:19:57,020 --> 00:19:57,940
感激不尽
Thank you.

453
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:05,000
费城牛肉奶酪三明治 人人有份啦
Philly cheesesteaks for everybody!

454
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,360
我终于活过来了
And you really haven't lived

455
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:09,140
之前在雪弗兰里跟九个牛肉三明治
until you've driven two hours in a Chevy

456
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,160
和一只爱放屁的动物待了两个小时 都要死了
with nine cheesesteaks and a gassy animal.

457
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:13,576
这有啥 我不就在车上吃完了
What? I ate mine in the car.

458
00:20:13,576 --> 00:20:15,960
厄尔 你错过了一场精彩的葬礼
Hey, Earl, you missed one hell of a funeral.

459
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,180
你真应该去的
You should have come.

460
00:20:17,340 --> 00:20:18,680
那有不少八九十岁的老辣奶
There were some hot octogenarians,

461
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:21,220
而且我接收到其中一位超强的"求欢"信号
and I got a definite "jungle fever" vibe from one of them.

462
00:20:22,140 --> 00:20:24,740
像我这种年纪的人 可不想在葬礼上出现
Girl, at my age, you don't go anywhere near funerals.

463
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:27,460
只要你一不小心打个瞌睡 就得花上六小时
You accidentally doze off, you spend six hours

464
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:28,980
把你自己从地里挖出来
digging yourself out of the ground.

465
00:20:33,780 --> 00:20:35,420
你还好吧 小鸡仔
Hey, how you holding up, chicken?

466
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:37,300
我没事 多谢关心
I'm okay. Thanks.

467
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,560
麦克斯 我死的时候
And Max, when I die,

468
00:20:38,780 --> 00:20:40,400
我不在乎我的葬礼都有谁出席
I don't care who else is at my funeral,

469
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:41,420
只要你来了就行
as long as you're there.

470
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:43,020
我当然会去
Of course I'll be there.

471
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:45,100
凶手向来为了甩掉警察而出席葬礼
The murderer always shows up to throw off the cops.

472
00:20:46,520 --> 00:20:48,180
对了 棺材别花太多钱
Also, save the money on a casket

473
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:50,600
给我一套迪奥寿服 化烟熏妆 扔洞里就行了
and just toss me in a hole wearing Dior and a smoky eye.

474
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:52,300
如果到时我很胖 那就火葬了吧
Unless I'm fat-- then burn me.

475
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,780
我不想要葬礼
Well, I don't want a funeral.

476
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:57,220
等我死的时候 把我尸体塞进大炮里
When I die, just shove my corpse into a cannon

477
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,960
直接冲着大西洋城特朗普赌场来一发 送我过去
and blow me directly into the Trump casino.
